    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Circuitborn Line.</strong> The war-plate. Made for impact, for holding the line, for being the thing the squad puts between itself and whatever just came through the gate.</p><p><em>“Captain Robot is not a robot. You are. Try not to make it weird about him.”</em></p><p><strong>Exo-Knight.</strong> You are a sentient chassis built around the principle of <em>presence</em>. When you stand somewhere, that ground belongs to your faction until something stronger walks you off it.</p><h3>Traits</h3><ul><li><strong>Creature Type.</strong> Humanoid (Construct-Living).</li><li><strong>Chassis Lean.</strong> Your chassis is built around <strong>VIO (Violence)</strong>—expressed primarily through Tier powers.</li><li><strong>Bulwark Frame.</strong> When an ally within 1 square of you is hit by an attack, you may use your reaction to impose 3d10 keep lowest 2 on the attack roll (1/Soma Break).</li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
